    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468810/extras/19195c93a93031304725941ad759f343.avif?t=1744806488\" /></span>A turn-based strategy game with roguelike and deck-building elements. Explore a dark and magical world full of forgotten lands, monsters, and secrets. Build your own deck of cards to fight your way through the dungeons. Upgrade your cards, unlock new items, and discover ancient artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468810/extras/658c9b9e300bc599fa8b01335319f368.poster.avif?t=1744806488\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468810/extras/658c9b9e300bc599fa8b01335319f368.webm?t=1744806488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468810/extras/0b9afe9a378a2b262049358207f855e5.avif?t=1744806488\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+50 cards to choose from and build decks with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 unique characters with different play styles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 biomes each with special interactions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iconic Boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+20 Items to collect</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468810/extras/81fd3cd9f97a656571b9c74dc3a62012.poster.avif?t=1744806488\" ><source src=\"https: